          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu atakayekwenda huko atakwenda na mishale na upinde; kwa sababu nchi yote itakuwa ina mbigili na miiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na vilima vyote vilivyolimwa kwa jembe, hutafika huko kwa sababu ya kuiogopa mbigili na miiba, lakini hapo patakuwa mahali pa kupeleka ng'ombe, mahali pa kukanyagwa na kondoo.",
          "type": "text",
